@Xudong07452910 你别说，你还真别说，Opus 5.5 还真能打！
我用了一下午，把之前 4.8 开发的一个迭代了三版的稀烂的工作流管线整个梳理了一下，好多了。
而且持续运行 token 消耗也没有暴涨，好感度大增啊！

@IndependentEco Yeah, I’m with you on this one.

Out of the latest models, Opus 5.5 has impressed me the most so far.

Especially for coding, it feels unusually strong.

@AnthropicAI  cooked with #Opus 5.5 so hard that I'm switching back from gpt-6-astra. 

In a number of complex coding tasks in my testing on a production code base, Opus 5.5 smoked gpt-6-astra in both speed and quality. The only place where astra leads for me is computer use. 

Anyone else feel this way?

@mahaoo_ASI Just finished a multi-hours working session with Astra on a decision-making framework.  

The starting of the exchange was a excellent report fully managed by Opus 5.5 on a complex SI topic. 

Indeed remarkable ! Even for non-coding tasks ...

@hany99dev Honestly, it's Opus 5.5... still using Astra but it lasts 2-3 days on 20x. GPT-6 Sol isn't as good and can't compete with Opus 5.5.

I have Opus 5.5 and Astra work together, but instead of complaining when Astra runs out, I just Opus.

Used a reset last night. https://t.co/G2MSjfl6b1

@leo_linsky Astra is Frontier in a few areas, but I will tell you where it's bottom of the pile, design. 

Ask it to create graphics, UI and Sound and it will fail miserable in comparison to Opus. 

5.5 is an absolute pleasure to use, I always trust it when it comes to graphics and design.
